#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3228
msgid ""
"trendfill : 勾配リッジ検出 + 2次トレンド除去 + "
"最近傍充填。勾配で繊維マスクを作り、試料傾斜を2次曲面で除いてから穴を埋める。汎用だがリッジ検出パラメータの調整が必要（1.0.0 では "
"'inpaint' という名前）"
msgstr ""
"trendfill: gradient ridge detection + second-order trend removal + "
"nearest-background fill. Creates a fiber mask from gradients, removes the"
" sample tilt with a second-order surface, then fills the holes. General-"
"purpose, but the ridge-detection parameters need tuning (named 'inpaint' "
"in 1.0.0)."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3229
msgid "tophat : 形態学的opening。tophat_se_size より細い明るい構造を前景として除去。マスク不要・高速・一様性に優れる"
msgstr ""
"tophat: morphological opening. Removes bright structures thinner than "
"tophat_se_size as foreground. No mask required, fast, and good "
"uniformity."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3230
msgid ""
"spline1d : 2次トレンド除去 + 行/列ごとの1D "
"B-スプライン補間。縞ノイズに有効。ライン端は外挿せず自ラインの水準を保持。spline1d_axis で縞の向きを選択"
msgstr ""
"spline1d: second-order trend removal + 1D B-spline interpolation by "
"row/column. Effective for stripe noise. The line ends hold that line's "
"own level instead of extrapolating. Select the stripe direction with "
"spline1d_axis."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3231
msgid "spline2d : 2D B-スプラインフィット。背景を行毎でなく2D問題として一括で解く。大局的に滑らかな背景に向く"
msgstr ""
"spline2d: 2D B-spline fitting. Solves the background as a single 2D "
"problem instead of row by row. Suitable for globally smooth backgrounds."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3243
msgid "[tophat時のみ] 構造要素直径"
msgstr "[tophat only] Structuring element diameter"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3244
msgid "最大ファイバー幅の2〜3倍。奇数(偶数は+1)"
msgstr ""
"Set to 2-3 times the maximum fiber width. Use an odd number (even values "
"are incremented by 1)."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3247
msgid ""
"[spline1d時のみ] "
"除去する縞の向き。'y'=横縞(各走査ラインが上下にずれるノイズ)を除去/各列を縦に補間。'x'=縦縞を除去/各行を横に補間(良好な結果が多い)"
msgstr ""
"[spline1d only] Direction of stripes to remove. 'y' removes horizontal "
"stripes (noise where scan lines shift up/down) and interpolates each "
"column vertically. 'x' removes vertical stripes and interpolates each row"
" horizontally (often gives good results)."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3250
msgid "[spline1d時のみ] 行/列スプライン order。実用範囲1〜3 (2=旧pandas互換)。点数不足の行は線形に自動フォールバック"
msgstr ""
"[spline1d only] Row/column spline order. Practical range is 1-3 (2 = "
"legacy pandas-compatible). Rows with too few points automatically fall "
"back to linear fitting."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3253
msgid "[spline2d時のみ] スプライン次数。実用範囲1〜3 (1=双線形、2=旧pandas互換、3=双立方)。[1,5]"
msgstr ""
"[spline2d only] Spline degree. Practical range is 1-3 (1 = bilinear, 2 = "
"legacy pandas-compatible, 3 = bicubic). [1,5]"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3255
msgid "[spline2d時のみ] フィット用画素サブサンプル係数。大きいほど高速、品質影響は微少。デフォルト4"
msgstr ""
"[spline2d only] Pixel subsampling factor for fitting. Larger values are "
"faster with only minor quality impact. Default is 4."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3262
msgid "[trendfill, spline1d, spline2d時] 背景範囲（中心±sigma*係数）を決める係数"
msgstr ""
"[trendfill, spline1d, spline2d] Factor that determines the background "
"range (center ± sigma * factor)."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3264
msgid "[trendfill, spline1d, spline2d時] [1,0,-1]の急変を繊維として除外する距離しきい値"
msgstr ""
"[trendfill, spline1d, spline2d] Distance threshold for excluding sudden "
"changes such as [1,0,-1] as fibers"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3266
msgid "[trendfill, spline1d, spline2d時] [1,-1]の急変が一定以上離れている場合に構造とみなすしきい値"
msgstr ""
"[trendfill, spline1d, spline2d] Threshold for treating [1,-1] sudden "
"changes as structures when they are separated by at least this distance"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3269
msgid ""
"[trendfill, tophat, spline1d時] Savitzky-Golayフィルタの窓幅（平滑化範囲）。spline1d "
"ではライン端に保持する水準の平均本数も兼ねる"
msgstr ""
"[trendfill, tophat, spline1d] Savitzky-Golay filter window length "
"(smoothing range). With spline1d it also sets how many samples are "
"averaged for the level held at the line ends."

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3271
msgid "[trendfill, tophat, spline1d時] Savitzky-Golayフィルタの多項式次数"
msgstr "[trendfill, tophat, spline1d] Savitzky-Golay filter polynomial order"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3274
msgid "中央値フィルタを最後にかける（点ノイズに強い）"
msgstr "Apply median filter at the end (robust against point noise)"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3277
msgid "[trendfill, spline1d, spline2d時] 繊維マスクを膨張させる画素数（0でdilationなし）"
msgstr ""
"[trendfill, spline1d, spline2d] Number of pixels to dilate the fiber mask"
" (0 = no dilation)"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3279
msgid "[trendfill, spline1d, spline2d時] dilation前にマスクから除外する連結成分の最小面積"
msgstr ""
"[trendfill, spline1d, spline2d] Minimum connected-component area to "
"exclude from the mask before dilation"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3280
msgid "1でフィルタ無効"
msgstr "1 disables the filter"

