msgstr "Maximum length to track short lines considered as branches"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3303
msgid "小さすぎる線分（ノイズ）を削除する面積しきい値"
msgstr "Area threshold to remove too-small line segments (noise)"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3304
msgid "骨格上の小ループ（マスクの穴由来の二重線）を1本に潰す最大囲み面積。0で無効"
msgstr ""
"Maximum enclosed area of small skeleton loops (double lines around mask "
"holes) collapsed into a single line. 0 disables"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:3305
msgid "高さに関係なく除去する行き止まりの短い枝の最大長。画素単位のため解像度に応じて調整。0で無効"
msgstr ""
